<p dir="auto">Chrome 145 adds support for Column wrapping for multicol, which includes the <code class="notranslate">column-height</code> and <code class="notranslate">column-wrap</code> properties. See <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5176206485618688" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5176206485618688</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">BCD already includes data for <code class="notranslate">column-height</code> and <code class="notranslate">column-wrap</code>, but the update also includes <code class="notranslate">column-height</code> as a component of the <code class="notranslate">columns</code> shorthand property.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds a sub-data point for <code class="notranslate">column-height</code> inside<code class="notranslate">columns</code>.</p>

